  "modifications": [
    "Separate one-forward-pass derivative retaining original Gerstner and two-way normal functions.",
    "Two half2 UV panner temporaries promoted to float2; original shader and materials untouched.",
    "World-metre depth reconstruction, lighter shore band, inner and pulsing broken outer foam, opaque-object intersection foam.",
    "Three low-amplitude sea/lake waves and crest caps; bounded two-phase UV1 world-XZ river advection and flowing foam.",
    "Sparse small sun glints, muted sky Fresnel, guarded OpaqueTexture refraction, shallow procedural caustics.",
    "Waterfall and FoamSplash modes; explicit editor test scene menu with one camera and numbered outputs.",
    "G14c replaces bright colours with muted sea/lake/river tones, warm E6E3D8 foam and 9FB3BF Fresnel; sea uses three colour stops.",
    "Candidate-only category entries outside Assets; numbered active v05 manifest remains untouched."
  ],
